{"seq":6,"slug":"application-security","title":"应用安全工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cybersecurity-applied","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security","rating":{"composite":4.07,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 应用安全工程 简介\n\n应用安全工程是网络安全体系中直接面向软件产品和服务的关键实践领域，聚焦于在软件开发、部署和运行的全生命周期中识别、预防和修复安全缺陷。在 2025—2026 年全球应用层攻击占比超过 70%、软件供应链攻击同比增长 150%、云原生应用已成为主流部署模式的背景下，将安全深度融入应用开发与运维流程已不再是可选项，而是工程团队的基本能力要求。\n\n本手册面向软件开发工程师、安全工程师和 DevOps 从业者，系统讲解从安全编码到安全测试、从 Web 应用防护到云原生安全的完整知识体系。无论你是刚开始接触安全开发的后端工程师，还是正在构建企业级安全测试体系的安全架构师，都能从中获得可落地的技术方案和最佳实践。\n\n全书共分为四章，由浅入深地覆盖应用安全工程的核心领域：\n\n第一章**安全开发实践**从安全软件开发生命周期（Secure SDLC）出发，讲解安全编码规范与常见缺陷的防范方法，并深入探讨 DevSecOps 流水线集成的工程实践，帮助团队在开发阶段就将安全\"内建\"到产品中。\n\n第二章**Web 应用安全**聚焦最广泛的攻击面——Web 应用，系统解析 OWASP Top 10 漏洞的成因与防御手段，深入讲解认证与授权的安全机制设计，以及 XSS、CSRF、CSP 等客户端安全防护技术。\n\n第三章**API 与云安全**覆盖现代架构中最关键的安全挑战：API 安全设计模式、容器安全与镜像加固、以及无服务器（Serverless）环境下的安全新课题。\n\n第四章**安全测试**介绍应用安全验证的核心方法论，包括 SAST/DAST 工具的选型与实践、模糊测试技术的原理与应用、以及日益严峻的软件供应链安全防护策略。\n\n建议读者按章节顺序学习，先掌握安全开发的基础理念与流程，再深入理解 Web 应用与 API 的具体攻防技术，最后学习安全测试方法以构建完整的应用安全验证能力。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"secure-development","title":"安全开发实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/secure-development","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"secure-sdlc","title":"安全软件开发生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/secure-development/secure-sdlc"},{"seq":2,"slug":"secure-coding-practices","title":"安全编码规范与常见缺陷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/secure-development/secure-coding-practices"},{"seq":3,"slug":"devsecops-pipeline","title":"DevSecOps 流水线集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/secure-development/devsecops-pipeline"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"web-security","title":"Web 应用安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/web-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"owasp-top-ten","title":"OWASP Top 10 深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/web-security/owasp-top-ten"},{"seq":2,"slug":"authentication-authorization","title":"认证与授权安全机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/web-security/authentication-authorization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"client-side-security","title":"客户端安全防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/web-security/client-side-security"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-cloud-security","title":"API 与云安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/api-cloud-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"api-security-design","title":"API 安全设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/api-cloud-security/api-security-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"container-security","title":"容器安全与镜像加固","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/api-cloud-security/container-security"},{"seq":3,"slug":"serverless-security","title":"无服务器安全挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/api-cloud-security/serverless-security"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"security-testing","title":"安全测试","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/security-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sast-dast-tools","title":"SAST 与 DAST 工具实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/security-testing/sast-dast-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fuzzing-techniques","title":"模糊测试技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/security-testing/fuzzing-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-security","title":"软件供应链安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/application-security/security-testing/supply-chain-security"}]}]}